      "value": "Here are other related posts that I think would further improve this change\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-current-avatar-shouldnt-be-displayed-in-the-local-profile\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1879-badges-shouldnt-be-their-own-bubble-anymore-in-the-profile",
