  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm in a few groups, I get invited to groups. I don't want them tied to my profile and online identity, I just want to support groups sometimes. But I will be leaving or private my groups over this change.\n\nThe only group I want on my profile, is the group I clicked \"represent group\" for. Instead, the group I represent is pushed off the the side of other icons and data and is smaller and cut off. It's not even the first to appear in my groups list, because the groups list is alphabetical.\n\nI have a UI edit made to show this in my first post which went over general feedback, https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1878-the-new-social-menu-ui-feedback-and-suggestions This post is specifically requesting this change to the groups bubble of the player profile.",
